Package: SyTrial
Type: Package
Title: Synthetic Control Arm Construction Using OMOP CDM and Advanced Causal Inference
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2025-01-15
Authors@R: c(
    person("Alexander", "Aleksiayuk", 
           email = "alexander_aleksiayuk@epam.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Maintainer: Alexander Aleksiayuk <alexander_aleksiayuk@epam.com>
Description: Constructs synthetic control arms from Real-World Data (RWD) stored 
    in OMOP Common Data Model (CDM) databases. Implements advanced causal inference 
    methods including Targeted Maximum Likelihood Estimation (TMLE), G-computation, 
    and Super Learner ensembles. Handles scenarios where control cohorts lack defined 
    index dates through intelligent imputation strategies. Integrates seamlessly with 
    OHDSI HADES framework.
